    {
      "step_id": "step_station_map_review_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "你开始翻来覆去地研究这张纸，约两分钟后，你终于不得不接受它已经在充分发挥过其作用后行至功成身退的时刻——",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_map_review_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_map_review_002",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "尼舍镇所在的位置只有一片密林，或许它的规模还不足以登上一张北郡地图。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_map_review_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_map_review_003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "那么就只能想想别的法子找路了……对了，我记得信里似乎提到过。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_give_letter_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_letter_review_001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "（耸肩）……“语焉不详的目的地线索”，是指这些意味不明的涂鸦吗？",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_letter_review_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_letter_review_002",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "这算是考核？好吧，真是位拧巴的委托人。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_letter_review_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_letter_review_003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "前面似乎有条小路，先过去看看吧。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_change_view_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "你走出车站，沿着杂草丛生的小径一路向前，不多时，便抵达了一处三岔路口。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_002",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "漆黑的林木立在两旁，仿佛某些上古神话里拱卫地狱之门的狠角色，过高的尺寸带来无言的压迫感。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_003",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "这里的树木似乎高耸异常。除此之外，你左右环顾，三条岔路看上去没什么不同。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_004",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_004",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "一根破旧的牌柱。不知已在此伫立多久，三个路牌歪歪扭扭地挂在上面，漆皮脱落后裸露出某种灰白底色，喑哑且斑驳地盘踞。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_005",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_005",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "【操作提示】点击路牌调查线索。点击画面左右两侧可以翻转路牌，别忘了查看背面。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_change_view_001",
      "type": "change_view",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "view_id": "view_forest_fork"
      },
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_fork_inspect_top_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "一块看上去有些年头的木板，上面歪歪扭扭地刻着1.5km。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_fork_inspect_top_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_fork_inspect_top_002",
      "type": "set_flag",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "flag_id": "flag_fork_top_inspected"
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_fork_inspect_middle_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "一块看上去有些年头的木板，上面歪歪扭扭地刻着3km。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_fork_inspect_middle_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_fork_inspect_middle_002",
      "type": "set_flag",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "flag_id": "flag_fork_middle_inspected"
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_fork_inspect_bottom_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "一块看上去还算光洁的木板，上面的字迹似乎是漆写的，尚未剥落。3km。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_fork_inspect_bottom_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_fork_inspect_bottom_002",
